        "headline": "Flood Advisory issued July 15 at 4:06PM AKDT until July 16 at 12:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall continues.\n\n* WHERE...Yentna River.\n\n* WHEN...Until noon AKDT Thursday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor flooding in low-lying and poor drainage areas.\nWater could enter several cabins along the Yentna River near Lake\nCreek.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 358 PM AKDT, river gauge reports high water levels from\nheavy rain across the advisory area. Minor flooding may be\nongoing, especially along the Yentna River near Lake Creek.\nAdditional rainfall amounts up to 1 i",
